Startup:

1. Hotstop telefon

2. Vezi ip hotspot:

hostname -I

3. Update la ip daca este diferit

Arduino sketch :
  const char* MQTT_BROKER = "<new-ip-here>";
Frontend (once built) — update its API base URL to http://<new-ip-here>:3000/api

4. Verif postgresql si mosquitto running:

sudo systemctl status postgresql mosquitto

5. Start bacnend

cd E:\Klover_backend
npm run dev

6. power esp32, vezi linia de connected

7. Check:

curl -X POST http://<ip>:3000/api/login -H "Content-Type: application/json" -d '{"password":"test123"}'
curl -X POST http://<ip>:3000/api/water/now -H "Content-Type: application/json" -H "x-api-key: <key-from-step-7>" -d '{"zone":"frontlawn","durationSeconds":10}'
